  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Organization for Social Science Research in Eaastern and Southern Africa (OSSREA) &#xE4;r ett regionalt n&#xE4;tverk f&#xF6;r forskare inom samh&#xE4;llsvetenskap. OSSREAs verksamhet syftar till att stimulera samh&#xE4;llsvetenskaplig forskning och att bidra till metodutveckling inom forskarutbildning vid nationella universitet.Sida ger total MSEK 21 under perioden 2010-2013.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Organization for Social Science Research in Eastern and Southern Africa (OSSREA) is a regional network for researchers in social sciences. OSSREA&apos;s activities aims at stimulating social science research, and contribute to improving knowledge in research  methodology at the post graduate level in State owned Universities. The totasl support is MSEK 21 during the period 2010-2013.</narrative>
  </description>
